Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, Alina, Zero Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:45.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you and why are you pursuing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:47.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:13.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Judging by the fact that you recognized the sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:14.84,general text,,0,0,0,,you must be a magician
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Put down your sword
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:24.94,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous to draw Jeonbugwan’s sword here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:29.98,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the village of Gema
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:34.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Mages of Jeonbugwan who came for magic are considered enemies here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:37.07,general text,,0,0,0,,If you get into a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:39.62,general text,,0,0,0,,and people will know that you are here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.70,general text,,0,0,0,,you will be in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:51.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Sounds like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:54.47,general text,,0,0,0,,as if you know who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:58.64,general text,,0,0,0,,You carry Jeonbugwan's gwangju sword
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:01.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you are his son
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:12.24,italics,,0,0,0,,Does he know what his father looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:18.46,general text,,0,0,0,,His father doesn’t have portraits like his mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:20.92,general text,,0,0,0,,We have no portraits of Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:23.84,general text,,0,0,0,,And the gentleman didn’t ask about him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:28.01,general text,,0,0,0,,He only saw his father as a child, so he doesn’t remember his face
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:31.39,general text,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t recognize his father,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:33.14,general text,,0,0,0,,even if it collides with him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:39.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I followed you only because I recognized the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:45.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know the owner of the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:51.28,general text,,0,0,0,,The man who left such a sword is crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.91,0:02:54.95,general text,,0,0,0,,His wife cheated on him and died
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:59.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Afterwards he abandoned his own son, resigned from his post and disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:02.92,general text,,0,0,0,,This crazy person is Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:08.84,general text,,0,0,0,,They say things like that about him behind his back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:11.80,general text,,0,0,0,,No one has ever said this to my face
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you have your own scores to settle with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:18.89,general text,,0,0,0,,What if so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:22.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Avenge me for your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.99,0:03:28.41,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I will not, even as his son
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.00,general text,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't want that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:38.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Then why do you carry your father’s sword with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:40.17,general text,,0,0,0,,If I deny that he is my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,my mother
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:44.72,general text,,0,0,0,,will look pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:49.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Before Hva...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.65,0:03:56.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Do Hwa was the biggest victim
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:07.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know my mother too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:13.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Do Hwa was the most beautiful woman in all of Daeho
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:18.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone in Deho knew her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:21.72,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems like everyone in my family is famous for something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I must say,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:28.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect to run into someone here who could recognize me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:58.85,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a place where people secretly practice magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.93,0:05:00.81,general text,,0,0,0,,despite the ban of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:05.27,general text,,0,0,0,,What is Gwangju Jeonbugwan's son doing in such a place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:06.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, they told me I could
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:10.07,general text,,0,0,0,,see here the magic of curses and souls
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.15,0:05:11.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the magician of Jeonjingak,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.40,general text,,0,0,0,,and are you interested in dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:16.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Not really
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.91,0:05:20.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm here to find the shaman who uses this magic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:23.58,general text,,0,0,0,,"Shaman"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.45,0:05:27.04,general text,,0,0,0,,This shaman possessed the magic of the soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:29.63,general text,,0,0,0,,which bewitched and drove people crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:33.17,italics,,0,0,0,,Twenty years ago she was caught
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:36.51,general text,,0,0,0,,magicians of Jeonbugwan, but she escaped after her house burned down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.93,0:05:40.93,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you need from shaman Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.43,0:05:43.52,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you know it was about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:49.56,general text,,0,0,0,,And you, by chance, are not the magician of Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:51.94,general text,,0,0,0,,who worked with my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:56.15,general text,,0,0,0,,The Choi family was a family of magicians,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:06:00.50,general text,,0,0,0,,which was destroyed by Master So Kyung a long time ago
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:04.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be curious
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:08.13,italics,,0,0,0,,If such interest consumes you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:12.22,general text,,0,0,0,,the darkness of this magic will take over your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:14.18,general text,,0,0,0,,and eventually you will lose everything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:17.81,general text,,0,0,0,,When this happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:20.69,general text,,0,0,0,,there will be no turning back
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:30.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Do not look for those who practice dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.49,general text,,0,0,0,,The world does not approve of such things,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:35.99,general text,,0,0,0,,and you will not be forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:43.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.30,0:06:50.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:04.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I am wounded to the very depths of my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he really like this because of dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:52.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:19.07,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Did she just look at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:23.03,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:25.24,memories,,0,0,0,,Can you help me lift the crutch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:28.58,voiceover,,0,0,0,,This is the girl I ran into at the house
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:48.40,italics,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:55.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:57.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she really Boo Young unnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:01.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is your sister
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:03.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Onnie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:12.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Boo Young, I'll take you to your room
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:47.21,general text,,0,0,0,,You are Chan Wook's maid
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.87,0:09:49.96,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:55.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I came to help Mrs. Jin escape from home
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:57.81,general text,,0,0,0,,But it seems I’d better leave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:59.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm already leaving
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.87,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What was Moo Deok doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:14.28,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I was sure that she didn’t recognize me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.41,0:10:17.20,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Should I have just killed her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:21.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young, nothing has changed in your room
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:25.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I knew that someday this day would come
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:38.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:57.95,general text,,0,0,0,,All your things
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:00.54,general text,,0,0,0,,still here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:04.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Since I almost died in the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:09.46,general text,,0,0,0,,every evening I had to wander around in search of accommodation for the night
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.22,0:11:11.93,general text,,0,0,0,,And now I have a room
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:18.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know that I had a mother who was waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:25.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Every day I suffered and suffered
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:31.91,general text,,0,0,0,,My poor child
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:35.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you will be happy every day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:38.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:43.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:04.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Did Jin Mu really find her daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:09.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. The girl opened the door to Jinyoung
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:12.58,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Did you open the doors?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:16.04,general text,,0,0,0,,These doors cannot be opened by any tricks
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:19.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Only the daughter of the Jin family is capable of this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:27.22,general text,,0,0,0,,So Jin Bu Young is back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:40.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do my eyes hurt so much every time I go to Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:49.63,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Is it because of their relics?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:10.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you look in the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you want to become nicer to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:21.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t talk nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:23.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh wait
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:25.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to become nicer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Choose something suitable for your owner
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:33.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll choose it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.93,general text,,0,0,0,,So how? Suits me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.01,0:13:42.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. You look great
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:45.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course it suits me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:47.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:51.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh, and that fits
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Hard to choose. Everything suits me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:00.50,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:04.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Give it to me. Now I'll paint you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:13.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Look how cute he is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:16.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm already cute enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.18,0:14:17.68,general text,,0,0,0,,now it’s your turn
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.31,0:14:25.19,general text,,0,0,0,,What a cutie our Moo Deok is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:30.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Childishness. I thought you only liked my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:33.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. I thought only the eyes were beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:37.04,general text,,0,0,0,,But your poison played a cruel joke on me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:38.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I like you anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:52.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I see how you try not to fall in love with me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:53.68,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s hard for you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:15:00.48,general text,,0,0,0,,But no. Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:07.57,general text,,0,0,0,,If you're going to lie to my face, at least play better
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:10.24,general text,,0,0,0,,The whole place turned red
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.99,0:15:15.96,general text,,0,0,0,,It's because of the blush!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:17.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:22.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I went too far. Doesn't come off
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:26.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You are now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:30.27,general text,,0,0,0,,you look like a drunk dog
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:36.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t look like that, she looks like a dog about to bite
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:39.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I can really bite
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.57,0:15:43.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t bite. Sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:49.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on, that’s enough
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I had to buy this because of you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:59.79,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t like it, don’t use it. I'll keep it for myself
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:03.13,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s cute too
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:06.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:24.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You almost got run over
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:35.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:38.82,general text,,0,0,0,,are you really drunk? Did you drink without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I drank too. Maybe together now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.16,0:17:46.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:49.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you go for a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:52.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I was in the village of Gema, they treated me there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:54.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Met shaman Choi there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:58.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Found a connection between her and Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:18:01.85,general text,,0,0,0,,And I also ran into the crown prince there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:03.69,general text,,0,0,0,,With the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:07.19,general text,,0,0,0,,He also suspects Jin Mu and the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:16.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:19.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you returning from the village of Gema?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:21.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:24.67,general text,,0,0,0,,The palace is like a labyrinth. I barely found my way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:26.38,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:29.84,general text,,0,0,0,,- Did something happen?\N- Deputy Jin Mu is here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:54.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Where did you go alone, without guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:58.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I am embarrassed that my attack did not go unnoticed. Let's leave it out
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:03.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:05.67,general text,,0,0,0,,He mentioned the King’s star again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:09.00,general text,,0,0,0,,He is obsessed with her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.09,0:19:12.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Give him at least a fake tablet with this star
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:15.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Then he will have to find everyone who was born that day
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:16.73,general text,,0,0,0,,and kill
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:19.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:22.07,general text,,0,0,0,,This could be a hero
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:25.07,general text,,0,0,0,,akin to Master So Kyung, and not a traitor and conspirator
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:27.66,general text,,0,0,0,,They say Seo Kyung saved the world with an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:28.70,general text,,0,0,0,,But this is not so
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.49,0:19:33.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Basically, he controlled the world, prohibiting everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:34.62,general text,,0,0,0,,use this enormous power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.62,0:19:38.42,general text,,0,0,0,,This stone creates dark magic, and it is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:40.67,general text,,0,0,0,,So Sosnovy Bor thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:45.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Ice stone can bring eternity into our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:47.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's stop growing old and dying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:51.51,general text,,0,0,0,,His power will make us forever young and beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:53.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about the alchemy of souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor banned this magic
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:56.94,general text,,0,0,0,,And if the ban is lifted
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:58.94,general text,,0,0,0,,and allow you to use the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:00.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:02.61,general text,,0,0,0,,what will happen then, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.03,0:20:09.49,general text,,0,0,0,,He who has the stone will live forever
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:13.83,general text,,0,0,0,,But it is dangerous to give such power to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.91,0:20:15.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Not for everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:18.62,general text,,0,0,0,,We will issue a decree according to which only the chosen ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:20.96,general text,,0,0,0,,how, for example, you can use this magic
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you need to find the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:29.34,general text,,0,0,0,,to make this possible
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.01,0:20:32.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Bu Young, Jinyoung's lost daughter, has returned
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:34.90,general text,,0,0,0,,- Jinyoewon?\N- Woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:39.20,general text,,0,0,0,,which helped Master Seo Kyung find the stone, was the first chapter of Jinyoewon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:41.49,general text,,0,0,0,,And Jin Bu Young is so strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:43.37,general text,,0,0,0,,like the first chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.21,0:20:51.13,general text,,0,0,0,,If the ice stone appears, like two hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:53.04,general text,,0,0,0,,heiress of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:56.30,general text,,0,0,0,,will find it immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:02.55,italics,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon's eldest daughter returned alive
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:05.93,general text,,0,0,0,,She seems like an ordinary blind girl
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:08.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought she was incredibly strong
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.27,0:21:10.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did she lose her strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:12.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:15.23,general text,,0,0,0,,she couldn’t find a house for ten years, so it’s possible
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.15,0:21:21.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu brought her, everything can’t be clean there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:23.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed anything strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:29.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I once ran into her at your house
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:34.29,italics,,0,0,0,,Remembered because I helped her lift her crutch
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.59,0:21:37.92,general text,,0,0,0,,At my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:40.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t notice anything strange about her then
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:41.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Today too
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:46.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Umbrella...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:52.44,general text,,0,0,0,,She had an umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:54.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I already saw it somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:57.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Umbrella? What's so special about an umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.99,0:21:59.04,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s not the point
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:01.91,general text,,0,0,0,,This umbrella is made of quality sheepskin and bamboo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.71,0:22:04.21,general text,,0,0,0,,It was very expensive
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:07.67,general text,,0,0,0,,- How did she get it?\N{\i1}- What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:09.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Who owned it before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:12.63,italics,,0,0,0,,Umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.22,0:22:15.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t have it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.59,0:22:17.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Gave to someone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:18.47,general text,,0,0,0,,To whom and where?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.27,0:22:20.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t do it on purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:22.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you bought it for me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:25.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.60,0:22:27.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you give it to the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:30.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, to a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:31.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Just don’t be angry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.95,0:22:35.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should I be angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:36.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.32,0:22:38.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.41,0:22:40.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Answer already! Tired of waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.95,0:22:42.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Which girl did you give it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.29,0:22:47.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.92,0:22:50.34,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not the right way to ask. Yul...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.71,0:22:53.92,general text,,0,0,0,,He turned pale with fear
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.01,0:22:56.30,general text,,0,0,0,,You scold him like a wife who caught him cheating
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.39,0:22:59.05,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t ask in such a tone... demanding
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.89,0:23:01.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Watch and remember. Yul,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:04.69,general text,,0,0,0,,did you give the umbrella to the blind girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.44,0:23:06.44,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.73,0:23:10.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is So Yi, who was already mentioned before?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:14.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I gave her the umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.25,0:23:15.37,italics,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.42,0:23:17.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Today I was in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:20.67,general text,,0,0,0,,There I saw their lost daughter Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.75,0:23:22.34,general text,,0,0,0,,She was blind,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:24.67,general text,,0,0,0,,but instead of a crutch she had an umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:26.76,general text,,0,0,0,,That same umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:31.18,italics,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.43,0:23:34.06,italics,,0,0,0,,Did you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.14,0:23:37.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Elder sister Cho Young has been found. They found Jin Bu Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:40.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:42.73,general text,,0,0,0,,What are these sour faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:44.78,general text,,0,0,0,,What were you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:47.40,general text,,0,0,0,,About So I, which we were looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:48.86,general text,,0,0,0,,So I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:51.12,general text,,0,0,0,,That scammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.70,0:23:52.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:55.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Bu Young, brought by Jin Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.91,0:23:57.12,general text,,0,0,0,,this is a scammer So Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.92,0:23:59.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, all those people were killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.88,0:24:01.79,general text,,0,0,0,,to hide who she is
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:18.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.73,0:24:25.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I will become your exact copy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.76,0:24:45.14,general text,,0,0,0,,The headband is the same as Moo Deok's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.31,0:24:49.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:53.02,italics,,0,0,0,,Boo Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.20,0:25:02.36,general text,,0,0,0,,You found out...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.49,0:25:04.53,general text,,0,0,0,,this bandage?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.75,0:25:13.79,italics,,0,0,0,,Jinyowon Coat of Arms
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.88,0:25:17.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I embroidered on all the headbands
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.88,0:25:20.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I was worried that something would happen to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.13,0:25:23.09,general text,,0,0,0,,because you are blind
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.18,0:25:27.51,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why I made you wear a headband with our family's crest
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.06,0:25:31.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.56,0:25:37.90,memories,,0,0,0,,The bandage is old, but silk
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.57,0:25:41.28,memories,,0,0,0,,Your real parents are probably rich
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.78,0:25:45.78,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you really blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.70,0:25:48.70,memories,,0,0,0,,I see everything, but I can’t find the stream
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.79,0:25:50.91,memories,,0,0,0,,But for you it’s not difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.55,0:25:58.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Bu Young, since childhood you have had the ability to sense energy
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.93,0:26:03.02,general text,,0,0,0,,You were able to find things faster than sighted people
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.60,0:26:06.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Didn’t get confused on the road, didn’t get lost
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.73,0:26:10.15,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Like Moo Dok in Sari Village
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.23,0:26:13.20,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,She found things easily and always knew where to go
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:15.11,general text,,0,0,0,,You were wearing exactly the same bandage...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.74,0:26:19.58,general text,,0,0,0,,the day you disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.74,0:26:24.21,general text,,0,0,0,,So I was hoping you would use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.58,0:26:26.92,general text,,0,0,0,,to find your way home
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.04,0:26:30.38,offscreen,,0,0,0,,She always treated this bandage with trepidation
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.46,0:26:32.92,voiceover,,0,0,0,,She said that this is the only way to find a home
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.68,0:26:36.47,general text,,0,0,0,,If you had saved it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.85,0:26:40.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I would recognize you immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.02,0:26:45.48,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,This woman sewed the headband that I stole from Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.60,0:26:48.19,italics,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.27,0:26:52.07,general text,,0,0,0,,that she returned safe and sound, Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:01.54,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,The real Boo Young, the daughter of this woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.29,0:27:04.37,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,my friend Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.45,0:27:28.66,memories,,0,0,0,,Boo Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.58,0:27:35.08,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Did Jinyoewon’s doors open because of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.21,0:27:38.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Deok is the real Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.25,0:27:42.71,general text,,0,0,0,,What will happen to me if she finds out about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.55,0:27:47.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Will they kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.97,0:27:54.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Onnie
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.43,0:27:56.93,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.60,0:27:59.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to open the doors again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.10,0:28:00.27,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.40,0:28:06.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I just can’t believe that you are really my family
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.82,0:28:09.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.03,0:28:11.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Believe
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:14.20,general text,,0,0,0,,We all saw how you opened the doors
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.87,0:28:21.88,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way, that girl who was with you last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.96,0:28:23.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.84,0:28:25.30,general text,,0,0,0,,She does not serve Jinyoewon
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.38,0:28:28.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Does she come here often? It seemed that mother knew her too
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.72,0:28:30.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother doesn’t like her
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.51,0:28:32.60,general text,,0,0,0,,You see, she’s nothing but problems
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.69,0:28:33.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.28,0:28:37.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently that’s why...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.69,0:28:39.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I felt negative energy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.74,0:28:43.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Negative energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.28,0:28:47.20,general text,,0,0,0,,The energy I felt was dark and unpleasant
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.08,0:28:51.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay away from people with that kind of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.67,0:28:54.79,general text,,0,0,0,,She's not such a bad person
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.88,0:28:57.21,italics,,0,0,0,,Here you are, girls
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.38,0:29:00.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:01.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.22,0:29:03.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young, mom is looking for you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.51,0:29:05.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.01,0:29:09.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought she wasn't angry anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.48,0:29:12.98,general text,,0,0,0,,- I'm off\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.98,0:29:20.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you to stay away from my daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.28,0:29:22.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.32,0:29:25.82,general text,,0,0,0,,On the last day of the month they are waiting for us in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.91,0:29:27.91,general text,,0,0,0,,- Be prepared\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.33,0:29:30.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Father, wait
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.12,0:29:34.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.00,0:29:39.46,general text,,0,0,0,,that Jin Bu Young is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.92,0:29:43.34,general text,,0,0,0,,What will happen to me if she returns?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.59,0:29:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t bother your head with such thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.97,0:29:50.14,general text,,0,0,0,,She's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.70,0:30:01.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if Moo Deok is their real daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.79,0:30:03.46,general text,,0,0,0,,none of them know about this
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.62,0:30:06.54,general text,,0,0,0,,We can’t let them find out
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.92,0:30:11.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:25.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about this all night
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.77,0:30:28.06,general text,,0,0,0,,This could jeopardize my love,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.15,0:30:31.65,general text,,0,0,0,,but I will fulfill my duty as the heir of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.73,0:30:34.28,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’ll go and tell my uncle everything\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.36,0:30:37.66,general text,,0,0,0,,You remember how he quarreled with Mrs. Jin?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.74,0:30:39.53,general text,,0,0,0,,If we have no evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.62,0:30:42.24,general text,,0,0,0,,let us declare that her daughter is a false Bu Young and a murderer,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:45.00,general text,,0,0,0,,relationships with Jinyeowon will completely deteriorate
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.21,0:30:47.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.42,0:30:51.34,general text,,0,0,0,,If the truth comes out, war will break out between Jin Mu and Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.00,0:30:54.51,general text,,0,0,0,,We can’t interfere until we find out everything
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:30:59.05,general text,,0,0,0,,But why did they bring the fraudster...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.14,0:31:00.85,general text,,0,0,0,,and they said that she is an heiress?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.93,0:31:03.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Because they need their man in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.93,0:31:05.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What if she gets caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.14,0:31:07.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother recognizes her child
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.23,0:31:10.66,general text,,0,0,0,,In the end, she will be caught. Why take such a risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.45,0:31:13.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Because for him it’s nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.45,0:31:17.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu probably has something,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.12,0:31:19.92,general text,,0,0,0,,which will not allow Jin Ho Kyung to do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.08,0:31:23.17,general text,,0,0,0,,even if it recognizes the substitution
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.93,0:31:32.51,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong with her
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.18,0:31:38.06,voiceover,,0,0,0,,She has the same scar and mole that Boo Young had
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.44,0:31:41.02,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,But the shape of the ears is different
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.77,0:31:45.23,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Ears never change
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.74,0:31:49.74,general text,,0,0,0,,My memory is failing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.87,0:31:53.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.13,0:32:12.84,general text,,0,0,0,,For help with the search for Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:16.52,general text,,0,0,0,,you asked permission to enter Jinyeowon, I'm surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.18,0:32:19.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I wasn’t allowed here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.06,0:32:22.23,general text,,0,0,0,,even though I am a member of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.31,0:32:24.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I punished you severely every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.40,0:32:27.15,general text,,0,0,0,,when you approached Jinyoewon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.90,0:32:30.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I was really too strict with you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.54,0:32:34.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I hated you, although you appeared because of your father’s adventures
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.29,0:32:36.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Despised for all your diligent attempts
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.75,0:32:38.67,general text,,0,0,0,,please and please everyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.42,0:32:40.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.55,0:32:46.30,general text,,0,0,0,,All this is in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.41,0:33:06.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Now Boo Young is back
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.24,0:33:12.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Quickly declare her your heir
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Appoint Boo Young as the next head of Jinyoung?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.30,0:33:22.80,general text,,0,0,0,,The new chapter will breathe life into Jinyeowon again
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.88,0:33:24.01,general text,,0,0,0,,And then
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.09,0:33:28.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I will make Cho Yeon crown princess
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.31,0:33:33.69,general text,,0,0,0,,No need to rush
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.77,0:33:35.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Boo Young’s memory has not yet returned
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.69,0:33:39.15,general text,,0,0,0,,And I’m still able to control Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.23,0:33:43.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Your strength is not enough to find the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.03,0:33:48.16,general text,,0,0,0,,When you carried Boo Young under your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.24,0:33:51.17,general text,,0,0,0,,you took the stone from Jinyoung and gave it to Chang Gang...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.80,0:33:53.13,general text,,0,0,0,,to save her life
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.38,0:33:57.93,general text,,0,0,0,,How did you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.01,0:33:59.22,general text,,0,0,0,,No need to be scared
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.30,0:34:01.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to convict you of crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.93,0:34:05.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Chang Gang insisted on sealing the stone somewhere else
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.06,0:34:07.60,general text,,0,0,0,,He didn’t give it back to you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.52,0:34:11.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know where he hid...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.23,0:34:12.90,general text,,0,0,0,,ice stone from Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.98,0:34:14.69,general text,,0,0,0,,The heiress of Jinyeowon is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.78,0:34:18.91,general text,,0,0,0,,so I will return the stone to where it belongs
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.03,0:34:22.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:23.45,italics,,0,0,0,,Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:25.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I just said I'd return it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:28.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t look for a catch
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.17,0:34:30.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Consider this as a gift that came with Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.96,0:34:34.59,general text,,0,0,0,,All that is required is to accept it with gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.15,0:34:56.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're asking
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.07,0:35:01.07,general text,,0,0,0,,blindly admit Boo Young if I want to get the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:04.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Get rid of suspicions and doubts, then you will find everything
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.70,0:35:09.12,general text,,0,0,0,,And the stone and the lost daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.84,0:35:12.47,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.60,0:35:19.02,general text,,0,0,0,,To protect the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.77,general text,,0,0,0,,crush Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.48,0:35:25.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to destroy Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.94,0:35:27.57,general text,,0,0,0,,The Collapse of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.61,0:35:32.16,general text,,0,0,0,,will allow us to seize the full power of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.84,0:35:50.84,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about the alchemy of souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.93,0:35:53.01,memories,,0,0,0,,Pine Forest banned this magic
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.22,0:35:55.72,memories,,0,0,0,,And if the ban is lifted
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.81,0:35:57.81,memories,,0,0,0,,and allow you to use the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.89,0:35:59.02,memories,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.77,0:36:01.60,memories,,0,0,0,,what will happen then, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.48,0:36:06.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Eternal life?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.03,0:36:15.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Has the petrification process stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.53,0:36:17.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Now he can breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.12,0:36:21.00,general text,,0,0,0,,And move your fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.83,0:36:24.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Kan was a magician with vast experience
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.13,0:36:27.34,general text,,0,0,0,,When did he become interested in witchcraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.42,0:36:30.60,general text,,0,0,0,,If Jin Mu told me that I could move the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.68,0:36:33.52,general text,,0,0,0,,in a young and beautiful body, I would peck
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.69,0:36:39.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. But I'm sure many would fall for it
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.69,0:36:41.19,general text,,0,0,0,,People don't talk about it openly
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.28,0:36:42.82,general text,,0,0,0,,only because of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:47.70,general text,,0,0,0,,First, Jeonbugwan and the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.78,0:36:52.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Now, it seems, Jin Mu’s hands have reached Jinyoewon
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.16,0:36:53.29,general text,,0,0,0,,But we can
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.37,0:36:56.71,general text,,0,0,0,,prove that he used soul alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.79,0:36:59.09,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as we interrogate Master Kahn,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.17,0:37:01.42,general text,,0,0,0,,we can finally catch Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.01,0:37:04.01,general text,,0,0,0,,He is not afraid of being caught
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.88,0:37:06.68,general text,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, he is plotting something again
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.14,0:37:10.22,italics,,0,0,0,,I can’t even imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.89,0:37:13.35,general text,,0,0,0,,how far he is willing to go
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.81,0:37:16.27,general text,,0,0,0,,And it scares me
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.07,0:37:27.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should I go to Jeonbugwan this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.57,0:37:30.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you have to suffer again because of another worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.70,0:37:32.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Just do what they say
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.66,0:37:37.92,general text,,0,0,0,,There will be a lot of people there. Watch what you say and do
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.24,0:38:07.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Today I will finally show you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.08,0:38:10.84,general text,,0,0,0,,our danzhu
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.51,0:38:19.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Come forward and show yourself to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.90,0:38:40.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Our Danzhu is not only the most powerful priestess of Deho,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.70,0:38:43.79,general text,,0,0,0,,but also the future chapter of Jinyeowon. Her name is Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.33,0:38:48.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Bow to Danzhu
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.14,0:39:07.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I will use it to reveal the ice stone to the world
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.36,0:39:10.24,general text,,0,0,0,,And then I will move my soul into her body
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.91,0:39:14.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I can be near and serve you,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.12,0:39:16.37,general text,,0,0,0,,sister
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.34,0:39:34.89,general text,,0,0,0,,The head of Jinyeowon convened a Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.97,0:39:36.97,general text,,0,0,0,,- Didn’t even discuss it with Sosnovy Bor?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.06,0:39:40.27,general text,,0,0,0,,She sent letters to all families. They're heading here now
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.81,0:39:44.98,italics,,0,0,0,,What this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.06,0:39:48.86,general text,,0,0,0,,is Jinyeowon going to pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.37,0:39:58.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Her son is now in Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.12,0:40:03.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.29,0:40:07.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon convened a Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.42,0:40:12.84,italics,,0,0,0,,Cho Young is here too
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.59,0:40:16.22,italics,,0,0,0,,The blind girl next to you is Boo Young?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.35,0:40:18.31,general text,,0,0,0,,So I?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.60,0:40:20.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.90,0:40:25.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Everything is happening faster than we thought
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.65,0:40:28.16,general text,,0,0,0,,They are going to use the fake Bu Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.24,0:40:30.12,italics,,0,0,0,,to do something today
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.42,0:40:40.67,general text,,0,0,0,,This must be Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.87,0:41:11.29,italics,,0,0,0,,The head of Jinyeowon invited the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.37,0:41:14.66,general text,,0,0,0,,and Jeonbugwan on the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.75,0:41:16.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Unified advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.21,0:41:19.34,general text,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.42,0:41:21.34,general text,,0,0,0,,To announce an important decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.42,0:41:24.38,general text,,0,0,0,,which will determine the future of all Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.68,0:41:37.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Real chaos has broken out in the capital due to numerous cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.27,0:41:39.31,general text,,0,0,0,,related to nomads,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.40,0:41:41.02,general text,,0,0,0,,despite the return of Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.82,0:41:45.65,general text,,0,0,0,,So Jinyeowon tried to help Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.74,0:41:47.58,general text,,0,0,0,,to find the source of witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.71,0:41:49.67,general text,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.21,0:41:54.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Our support was taken for granted
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.01,0:41:59.97,general text,,0,0,0,,and arrogantly put forward unreasonable demands and requests
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.14,0:42:05.43,italics,,0,0,0,,They broke into Jinyeowon the same way they broke into Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.52,0:42:08.73,italics,,0,0,0,,justifying themselves by saying that they are looking for traces of dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.81,0:42:12.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Moreover, they tried to use the relics of Jinyaewon,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.32,0:42:14.15,general text,,0,0,0,,to check all magician families
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.23,0:42:17.03,general text,,0,0,0,,As if everyone outside the walls of Sosnovy Bor resorts to witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.96,0:42:20.07,italics,,0,0,0,,Moreover,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.16,0:42:24.08,general text,,0,0,0,,they brought one of our relics to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.58,0:42:26.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor doesn’t trust us?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.66,0:42:28.00,italics,,0,0,0,,This is too much
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.83,0:42:33.71,italics,,0,0,0,,Chief Jin, you have convened the Unified Council,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.80,0:42:36.92,general text,,0,0,0,,to speak out and complain about Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.01,0:42:37.97,italics,,0,0,0,,You see for yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.05,0:42:40.34,general text,,0,0,0,,As soon as I started talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.43,0:42:42.30,general text,,0,0,0,,how he immediately rushes to shut me up
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:44.93,italics,,0,0,0,,I, Jin Ho Kyung, head of Jinyoewon
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.01,0:42:49.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to stop this outrage, allegedly committed to search for dark magic
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.85,0:42:52.48,general text,,0,0,0,,In connection with which I break the rule introduced 200 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.56,0:42:57.53,general text,,0,0,0,,observed to this day. That's why I gathered you all here
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.28,0:43:02.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.51,0:43:16.97,italics,,0,0,0,,This is Jin Bu Young, heiress of Jinyoung,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.06,0:43:18.43,general text,,0,0,0,,returning after 10 years
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.02,0:43:23.27,italics,,0,0,0,,I heard she found her daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.86,0:43:24.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, this is her
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.48,0:43:31.53,italics,,0,0,0,,I have something to show you, and my daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.61,0:43:34.20,general text,,0,0,0,,will help me with this
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.13,0:43:50.88,general text,,0,0,0,,The pine forest was looking for an ice stone everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.97,0:43:52.88,general text,,0,0,0,,which is the source of the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.97,0:43:55.68,general text,,0,0,0,,However, all this time, he was in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.57,0:44:45.49,italics,,0,0,0,,So that’s Jin Mu’s plan
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.03,0:44:49.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Use Jinyeowon to introduce the ice stone to the world
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.41,0:44:50.91,general text,,0,0,0,,This is just the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.83,0:44:55.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Those who are suspected will try to move the souls
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.21,0:44:59.38,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.00,0:45:01.00,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.59,0:45:04.30,general text,,0,0,0,,The queen had the ice stone, but now it is with Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.38,0:45:06.26,general text,,0,0,0,,So, shaman Choi will leave the queen’s body
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.34,0:45:09.51,italics,,0,0,0,,and will transfer to the body of someone from Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.31,0:45:14.18,general text,,0,0,0,,She will leave the queen's body
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.02,0:45:19.73,general text,,0,0,0,,and will migrate to the body of the future head of Jinyeowon,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.02,0:45:22.48,general text,,0,0,0,,using soul alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.50,0:45:37.21,italics,,0,0,0,,The first one is very nice
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.92,0:45:39.33,general text,,0,0,0,,A unified council was convened, they say
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.42,0:45:41.88,general text,,0,0,0,,They will talk about nomads
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.96,0:45:43.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.80,0:45:47.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Do not buy unnecessary jewelry. Better take gold
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.73,0:45:50.23,general text,,0,0,0,,In dark times, you can only hope for gold
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.31,0:45:53.15,general text,,0,0,0,,There will be plenty of work to do when the council ends
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.23,0:45:54.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.15,0:45:56.57,general text,,0,0,0,,They will finish and everyone will immediately go drink
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.65,0:45:59.32,general text,,0,0,0,,- People will tell nasty things about Sosnovy Bor \N-{\i1} Hey{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.41,0:46:01.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop trying everything, buy it already
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.03,0:46:04.54,general text,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you? Give her time
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.62,0:46:06.08,italics,,0,0,0,,I want to buy everything
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.16,0:46:08.16,italics,,0,0,0,,- Let me try\N- This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.84,0:46:15.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the capital is just talking about the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.50,0:46:17.30,general text,,0,0,0,,yes about the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.30,0:46:21.51,general text,,0,0,0,,He'll have to come back because of all this fuss
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.97,0:46:24.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about Master Chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.85,0:46:30.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I also thought, it’s strange that Dan Gu is asking me
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.31,0:46:32.02,general text,,0,0,0,,about Mr. Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.10,0:46:35.65,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that the head of Sosnovy Bor is waiting for his appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.24,0:46:44.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Take this
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.99,0:46:46.79,italics,,0,0,0,,Give to Chang Gun when he appears
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.75,0:46:48.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.66,0:46:50.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.68,0:47:03.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Immediately empty
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.22,0:47:07.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you use the same spell as in "Words of the Heart"?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.07,0:47:12.61,general text,,0,0,0,,When Chang Gang reads it, he will do what it says
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:23.42,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way, don’t you need to attend the council?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.00,0:47:26.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a student of teacher Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.59,0:47:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,If I go there,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.26,0:47:34.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I can neither support nor condemn the actions of my teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.31,0:47:44.52,italics,,0,0,0,,So Master So Kyung kept the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.60,0:47:46.98,italics,,0,0,0,,I thought he destroyed them all
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.06,0:47:48.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.86,0:47:51.11,general text,,0,0,0,,If so, then everything that Sosnovy Bor did,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.19,0:47:54.16,general text,,0,0,0,,justified by the words of Master So Kyung, deception?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.24,0:47:56.74,general text,,0,0,0,,- Nonsense!\N-{\i1} Yes, this is a real scam{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.82,0:47:58.78,italics,,0,0,0,,So many rules have been introduced for the families of magicians,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.87,0:48:01.37,general text,,0,0,0,,explaining everything by saying that dark magic is being watched
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.45,0:48:02.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.75,0:48:05.00,general text,,0,0,0,,- Exact\N- Everything is correct
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.08,0:48:07.00,italics,,0,0,0,,Pine forest led us by the nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.08,0:48:08.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Are we fooled?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.50,0:48:10.88,italics,,0,0,0,,- Have you really been fooled?\N{\i0}- Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.42,0:48:13.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Our magicians did not suspect...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.72,0:48:17.60,general text,,0,0,0,,that the ice stone is kept in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.30,0:48:20.35,italics,,0,0,0,,We don’t want to listen to your excuses
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.43,0:48:21.77,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to decide what’s next
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.85,0:48:25.70,general text,,0,0,0,,do with the stone that remains
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.78,0:48:28.82,general text,,0,0,0,,It must be destroyed. This is the source of witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.33,0:48:31.20,general text,,0,0,0,,This is what Master So Kyung bequeathed
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.95,0:48:33.45,general text,,0,0,0,,We must destroy the stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.29,0:48:36.46,general text,,0,0,0,,in front of everyone present
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.96,0:48:39.79,general text,,0,0,0,,He himself left the ice stone in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.88,0:48:42.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's follow his decision and leave the stone there
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.80,0:48:46.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Then there was no need to bring it here
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.18,0:48:49.68,italics,,0,0,0,,How can you sit still now that you have shown everyone that it exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.76,0:48:52.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make Sosnovy Bor a laughing stock?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.64,0:48:55.43,general text,,0,0,0,,The head of Jinyeowon says it all
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.52,0:48:56.98,general text,,0,0,0,,She follows the will of the master,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.06,0:48:59.10,general text,,0,0,0,,what the ice stone left in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.19,0:49:03.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor no longer has the right to tell us what to do with the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.98,0:49:07.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Outrageous! Do you no longer care about the opinion of Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.32,0:49:09.91,general text,,0,0,0,,We came here to discuss...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.99,0:49:12.83,general text,,0,0,0,,how to use the stone, based on the will of Master Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.91,0:49:15.29,general text,,0,0,0,,If Sosnovy Bor doesn’t like something, leave
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.37,0:49:16.91,italics,,0,0,0,,- You’re right\N - Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.00,0:49:19.33,italics,,0,0,0,,You lied to us, so it’s not up to you to decide now
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.42,0:49:22.09,italics,,0,0,0,,- Exactly, you don’t have the right to vote\N- Don’t interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.17,0:49:23.38,italics,,0,0,0,,If you’re against it, leave
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.46,0:49:25.84,italics,,0,0,0,,- Just leave!\N- Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.92,0:49:27.30,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,So that's why Jin Mu...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.38,0:49:30.64,offscreen,,0,0,0,,showed the ice stone to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.72,0:49:33.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Now the opinion of Sosnovy Bor is not justified,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.72,0:49:36.10,italics,,0,0,0,,no one wants to listen to them
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.15,0:49:44.48,italics,,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.08,0:49:46.33,italics,,0,0,0,,If Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.41,0:49:49.04,italics,,0,0,0,,against the stone remaining in Jinyowon,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.58,0:49:52.63,general text,,0,0,0,,shall we give it to a third party for storage?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.59,0:49:54.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Here is my proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.05,0:49:56.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Shall we move it to Zhisan?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.55,0:49:59.38,general text,,0,0,0,,What nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.47,0:50:01.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is this going straight to Zhisan?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.43,0:50:03.10,general text,,0,0,0,,You and your family are low-level magicians!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.18,0:50:04.14,general text,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.22,0:50:07.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Your family has no right to keep the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.10,0:50:09.02,general text,,0,0,0,,- We are against\N- Don’t we have the right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.60,0:50:12.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Our family is the oldest in Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.90,0:50:15.15,general text,,0,0,0,,We have all the rights to protect the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.23,0:50:17.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are you pulling your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.40,0:50:20.03,general text,,0,0,0,,-Are you looking for a fight? \N- And myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.11,0:50:22.57,italics,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing?\N- Watch your language
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.16,0:50:25.16,italics,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.24,0:50:27.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Small morel!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.37,0:50:28.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Am I the morel?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.91,0:50:30.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.41,0:50:31.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.34,0:50:37.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.59,0:50:39.63,italics,,0,0,0,,Damn you, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.47,0:50:42.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Oh you...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.89,0:50:45.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.31,0:50:50.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you aiming at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.56,0:50:52.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Excellent. Come on, attack
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.06,0:50:55.98,italics,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.07,0:50:58.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think I can’t?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.28,0:50:59.65,general text,,0,0,0,,As impudent as you seem
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.74,0:51:01.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Whose cow would moo!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.57,0:51:04.83,italics,,0,0,0,,Grandfather on the Unified Council?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.92,0:51:05.75,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.34,0:51:09.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t find the textbook you asked for in Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.17,0:51:12.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go there and look for it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.55,0:51:15.72,general text,,0,0,0,,The council is discussing something important, probably
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.80,0:51:18.68,general text,,0,0,0,,All the magicians of Sejukwon went there
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.60,0:51:26.11,general text,,0,0,0,,They said my son is still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.30,0:51:52.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Ji Ho...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.40,0:52:12.74,general text,,0,0,0,,You are alive
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.45,0:52:22.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Ji Ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.49,0:52:51.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Calm down and sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.00,0:52:56.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Now is the time
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.46,0:52:59.21,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s time for Jin Ho Kyung to intervene and resolve the dispute
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.59,0:53:11.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.06,0:53:16.60,italics,,0,0,0,,- I’ll deal with you later!\N- Well, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.68,0:53:18.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.02,0:53:19.90,italics,,0,0,0,,I will continue
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.10,0:53:23.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Based on general opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.11,0:53:25.15,general text,,0,0,0,,we'd better use the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.23,0:53:29.20,general text,,0,0,0,,For the benefit of all present
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.41,0:53:31.49,italics,,0,0,0,,So I,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.57,0:53:36.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Ho Kyung, head of Jinyoewon, I would like to suggest the following
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.20,0:53:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,From now on, the right to convene the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.25,0:53:44.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Jinyeowon, not Sosnovy Bor, will have
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.23,0:53:51.94,italics,,0,0,0,,If everyone agrees with this proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.02,0:53:53.86,general text,,0,0,0,,we'll finish here
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.94,0:53:57.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Now Jinyeowon will conduct all discussions regarding the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.40,0:54:00.95,general text,,0,0,0,,not Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.66,0:54:08.16,italics,,0,0,0,,I will consider this as agreement
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.25,0:54:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,and I’ll end today’s meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.87,0:54:15.25,general text,,0,0,0,,The ice stone will remain in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.46,0:54:18.01,general text,,0,0,0,,We must destroy the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.92,0:54:22.97,general text,,0,0,0,,This way we will prevent future quarrels
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.05,0:54:25.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right to make such a decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.60,0:54:26.93,general text,,0,0,0,,All present are against
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.01,0:54:30.06,general text,,0,0,0,,A case of soul alchemy was recorded
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.14,0:54:32.52,general text,,0,0,0,,And all because of the reflectors made of stone
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.60,0:54:34.73,general text,,0,0,0,,At first they doubted Jeonbugwan and the royal family
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.81,0:54:37.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you do the same with Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.73,0:54:42.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I will not let the Unified Council end like this
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.57,0:54:44.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.82,0:54:50.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I forbid you to take the ice stone out of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.91,0:54:54.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you going to go against everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.12,0:54:55.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Nobody
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.67,0:54:59.05,general text,,0,0,0,,will not take the ice stone from Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.23,0:55:09.65,italics,,0,0,0,,We will use force against anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.07,0:55:13.28,general text,,0,0,0,,who will try to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.24,0:55:19.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Then the war will begin
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.58,0:55:29.29,general text,,0,0,0,,The situation has reached its peak
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.38,0:55:31.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you should intervene
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.92,0:55:34.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li was right
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.34,0:55:37.05,memories,,0,0,0,,Everyone wanted to get the stone, so the fighting began
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.14,0:55:38.72,memories,,0,0,0,,That's why the stones were destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.68,0:55:42.60,italics,,0,0,0,,Everyone is fighting over a stone
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.27,0:55:44.48,italics,,0,0,0,,So the King's star...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.56,0:55:46.90,general text,,0,0,0,,also true
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.53,0:56:34.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I see all my former teachers are here
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.20,0:56:38.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Let your former student greet you
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.00,0:56:40.75,italics,,0,0,0,,Who is this young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.83,0:56:42.09,italics,,0,0,0,,This is Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.17,0:56:44.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Ignorant from the Chan family. He was also my student
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.84,0:56:48.26,italics,,0,0,0,,If I’m not confused, then your family tried to teach him
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.88,0:56:51.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. He ran away after three days
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.39,0:56:54.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for interrupting your passionate discussion
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.10,0:56:57.85,italics,,0,0,0,,beat of the drum
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.60,0:57:03.36,general text,,0,0,0,,- Should I stop him?\N- Let him talk
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.94,0:57:06.99,general text,,0,0,0,,He managed to stop their battles
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.69,0:57:09.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook, son of Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.41,0:57:14.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you have a good reason for ranting like that
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.58,0:57:16.83,general text,,0,0,0,,before His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.04,0:57:23.46,general text,,0,0,0,,I have come to announce the will of Master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.64,0:57:37.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I revealed to him the true intentions of the teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.18,0:57:38.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope he will act wisely
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.03,0:57:48.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I speak on behalf of Master Lee, a student of So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.75,0:57:51.04,general text,,0,0,0,,So I hope everyone will show respect...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.12,0:57:53.00,general text,,0,0,0,,and listen to the will of Master So
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.68,0:58:03.76,general text,,0,0,0,,According to Master Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.84,0:58:06.30,general text,,0,0,0,,master Seo Kyung's will regarding the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.39,0:58:08.10,general text,,0,0,0,,written in “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.60,0:58:12.98,general text,,0,0,0,,There he stated why he did not destroy the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.06,0:58:15.65,general text,,0,0,0,,and left the book to all the magicians, so that everyone knows
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.73,0:58:18.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Pine forest did not hide anything
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.07,0:58:25.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Most of those present read “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.07,0:58:29.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Our duty is to find the will of Master So Kyung in the book
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.62,0:58:34.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what it was about?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.37,0:58:37.04,general text,,0,0,0,,No, I read it a long time ago
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.13,0:58:38.80,italics,,0,0,0,,Do you want to say, in this poem...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.88,0:58:40.92,general text,,0,0,0,,he wrote, why did he leave the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.72,0:58:43.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.88,0:58:47.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I was told that everyone follows the postulates of Master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.55,0:58:50.02,general text,,0,0,0,,So you don’t need to argue about the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.10,0:58:52.35,general text,,0,0,0,,and about the meaning of “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.43,0:58:55.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are those “Words of the Heart” that he talks about?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.27,0:58:58.06,general text,,0,0,0,,This poem was kept in Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.15,0:59:02.04,general text,,0,0,0,,but by order of Master Lee, we recently sent her to Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.75,0:59:06.33,general text,,0,0,0,,It is kept in Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.42,0:59:08.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Then bring the book here
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.67,0:59:11.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.26,0:59:21.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Jin Cho Young from Jinyoung
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.72,0:59:24.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I will bring “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.27,0:59:27.02,general text,,0,0,0,,The book was previously kept with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.10,0:59:29.27,general text,,0,0,0,,I will also send someone
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.02,0:59:32.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Pak Dan Gu, go with her
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.49,0:59:39.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.55,0:59:56.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I've been for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.59,1:00:01.35,general text,,0,0,0,,"Words of the Heart" did not re-read
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.43,1:00:03.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Can you remind me what it’s about?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.64,1:00:05.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Just a short poem
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.06,1:00:09.48,general text,,0,0,0,,It turns out that Uk is lying?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.56,1:00:11.65,general text,,0,0,0,,It doesn't say anything about the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.40,1:00:16.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand why he suddenly started talking about “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.53,1:00:22.04,general text,,0,0,0,,What’s in these “Words of the Heart”?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.13,1:00:23.50,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know either
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.59,1:00:28.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I guess he's bluffing. Wants to buy time
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.93,1:00:31.22,general text,,0,0,0,,But this book was written by Seo Kyung himself
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.93,1:00:34.64,general text,,0,0,0,,We have almost undermined trust in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.72,1:00:37.06,general text,,0,0,0,,What if everything turns out to be in vain?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.69,1:00:42.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, they seem to be angry
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.02,1:00:45.19,general text,,0,0,0,,And soon they will be very surprised
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.07,1:00:47.28,general text,,0,0,0,,But for this
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.28,1:00:49.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I need his help
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.29,1:01:04.50,general text,,0,0,0,,It's just a poem
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.59,1:01:07.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there some hidden meaning in it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.88,1:01:10.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.09,1:01:13.76,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Maybe he used the book to buy time
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.39,1:01:16.35,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,If this is the case,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.85,1:01:18.64,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I need to help him
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.31,1:01:20.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.94,1:01:22.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.19,1:01:25.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly hungry. Is there anything to eat here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.11,1:01:27.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Didn’t even have time to have breakfast
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.49,1:01:31.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you deliberately trying to buy time for Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.82,1:01:37.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go back and watch everyone go crazy again?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.83,1:01:39.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t have time to argue
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.95,1:01:41.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother and sister are waiting
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.30,1:01:43.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.30,1:01:46.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.85,1:01:49.68,general text,,0,0,0,,what is this your real sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.35,1:01:52.39,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.48,1:01:57.77,general text,,0,0,0,,The real culprit of the murders that Moo Deok was accused of,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.86,1:01:59.57,general text,,0,0,0,,a girl named So Yi
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.03,1:02:03.95,general text,,0,0,0,,The girl you call sister,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.32,1:02:06.62,general text,,0,0,0,,the same So I
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.91,1:02:10.08,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.39,1:02:33.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you told Cho Young that you don’t like this girl
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.90,1:02:37.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.90,1:02:40.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Bad energy comes from her
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.07,1:02:43.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want her to come near me again
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.87,1:02:52.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I will make sure you are always safe
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.12,1:02:54.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll get rid of her
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.68,1:03:02.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you, mother
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.04,1:03:31.34,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,She has changed
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.21,1:03:33.88,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Does she know it’s a substitution?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.30,1:03:37.30,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Use her knowing she’s fake?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.55,1:03:42.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you stalling for time, hiding behind a poem?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.31,1:03:49.31,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Chronicle of Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.02,1:03:53.69,italics,,0,0,0,,Fifth of May
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.78,1:03:55.94,italics,,0,0,0,,When Gwangju Chang Gan tried to catch the shaman Choi,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.03,1:03:58.70,italics,,0,0,0,,in order to convict her of using dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.78,1:04:01.28,italics,,0,0,0,,she jumped into the fire
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.37,1:04:03.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Dead
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.58,1:04:06.58,general text,,0,0,0,,The story of the shaman Bon from the village of Gema
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.33,1:04:08.67,general text,,0,0,0,,saved in records
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.25,1:04:13.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps shaman Choi and Jin Mu met then
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.17,1:04:16.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you so persistently looking for this shaman Choi?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.38,1:04:19.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you find the house that Eunuch Kim visited in Gema?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.19,1:04:22.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.02,1:04:25.69,general text,,0,0,0,,He often went to a shop with medicinal herbs
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.78,1:04:27.15,general text,,0,0,0,,A shop, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.78,1:04:30.36,general text,,0,0,0,,I shared it with you. Now it's your turn
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.95,1:04:33.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Eunuch Kim
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.95,1:04:36.37,general text,,0,0,0,,called the person he served as shaman Choi
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.25,1:04:42.17,general text,,0,0,0,,The man whom the eunuch Kim served...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.25,1:04:44.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty the Queen
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.55,1:04:48.67,italics,,0,0,0,,I know, you suspected her yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.76,1:04:51.63,general text,,0,0,0,,The soul of the real queen is still alive
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.47,1:04:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Most likely she is where eunuch Kim went
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.26,1:04:58.10,general text,,0,0,0,,How do you know she's alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.15,1:05:05.61,general text,,0,0,0,,The Queen's Lantern of Life still burns
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.69,1:05:07.53,general text,,0,0,0,,She is a member of the So family
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.19,1:05:09.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find the real queen...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.61,1:05:12.66,general text,,0,0,0,,and I will reveal the true essence of the one who is now sitting on the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.66,1:05:20.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to involve me in this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.12,1:05:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,This concerns your mother
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.00,1:05:29.30,general text,,0,0,0,,A with a stone
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.38,1:05:31.51,general text,,0,0,0,,what will you do then?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.59,1:05:33.47,general text,,0,0,0,,As Master Seo Kyung bequeathed
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.55,1:05:35.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I will do as it is written in “Words of the Heart”
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.55,1:05:36.43,italics,,0,0,0,,Uk
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.39,1:05:39.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Words of the Heart doesn’t talk about the stone
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.69,1:05:43.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you were lying to buy time
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.40,1:05:44.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t lie
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.45,1:05:47.12,general text,,0,0,0,,The reason really
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.20,1:05:50.12,general text,,0,0,0,,written in the poem by master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.46,1:05:58.13,general text,,0,0,0,,The ice stone contains the power of Hwangsu. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.21,1:06:00.84,general text,,0,0,0,,It contains the forces that control water, fire and wind
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.92,1:06:03.84,general text,,0,0,0,,And also the power that controls the souls of people
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.80,1:06:05.89,italics,,0,0,0,,Therefore his strength
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.97,1:06:08.18,general text,,0,0,0,,should be banned for humanity
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.26,1:06:11.56,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s hard to believe that in such a small piece of ice
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.64,1:06:12.81,general text,,0,0,0,,so much power
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.89,1:06:14.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to see for myself
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.48,1:06:21.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Have any of you seen the stone in action?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.32,1:06:27.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you really fight over a piece of ice whose strength you didn’t even see?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.04,1:06:32.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Then... maybe we’ll check,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.79,1:06:36.08,general text,,0,0,0,,let's check its strength in front of everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.87,1:06:38.92,general text,,0,0,0,,How exactly do you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.00,1:06:40.21,general text,,0,0,0,,If he controls souls,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.92,1:06:43.59,general text,,0,0,0,,so it can bring the dead back to life?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.09,1:06:47.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Hwangsu is not witchcraft, there is no ban on it
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.89,1:06:49.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, we’ll bring back the dead, it’s a good thing
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.35,1:06:52.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Chief Jin, you brought a stone here,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.14,1:06:55.60,general text,,0,0,0,,show his power
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.06,1:06:58.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.48,1:07:01.53,general text,,0,0,0,,everyone here is alive. Who do you propose to resurrect?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.95,1:07:04.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Then kill someone
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.54,1:07:11.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Here you are
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.88,1:07:17.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Come here
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.34,1:07:20.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.60,1:07:27.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Kill her and bring her back to life
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.81,1:07:29.35,general text,,0,0,0,,She is a maid, she doesn’t know any spells
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.94,1:07:33.15,italics,,0,0,0,,So you don’t have to worry about letting her near the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.23,1:07:34.07,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.15,1:07:36.53,general text,,0,0,0,,you cannot kill a person just out of curiosity
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.61,1:07:38.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I just want to see her come to life
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.07,1:07:39.95,general text,,0,0,0,,using this
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.03,1:07:42.08,italics,,0,0,0,,How can you ask a weak girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.16,1:07:44.45,general text,,0,0,0,,experience this?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.08,1:07:49.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Answer
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.25,1:07:51.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.09,1:07:56.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I will pay you 100 gold nannies
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.30,1:07:58.63,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.01,1:08:03.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.89,1:08:05.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I agree
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.47,1:08:07.60,italics,,0,0,0,,I will sacrifice myself,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.35,1:08:11.90,general text,,0,0,0,,to show the power they want to see
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.98,1:08:14.86,general text,,0,0,0,,all present
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.31,1:08:45.69,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Here's my chance to get the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.44,1:08:51.95,voiceover,,0,0,0,,For this I must first die
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.66,1:08:57.66,offscreen,,0,0,0,,No one here cares whether I die or not
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.91,1:09:01.50,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,They are just curious to see
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.00,1:09:03.96,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,the power of the stone
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.35,1:09:26.52,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I can't know if I'm going to die...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.02,1:09:30.82,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,or I will regain my power thanks to the stone
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.07,1:09:34.16,offscreen,,0,0,0,,I'm standing on the edge of a cliff,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.11,1:09:38.16,offscreen,,0,0,0,,and in front of me is an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.24,1:09:39.75,memories italics,,0,0,0,,I missed you too
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.05,1:09:44.05,memories,,0,0,0,,Here is my answer
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.22,1:09:48.64,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're not here
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.81,1:09:52.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Words of the Heart talks about the desire to save a loved one
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.14,1:09:55.19,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a letter from Master Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.27,1:09:57.69,general text,,0,0,0,,dedicated to a dying loved one
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.77,1:10:00.61,general text,,0,0,0,,He wrote that he left something that would help keep his beloved close
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.69,1:10:02.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to say that the great hero,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.36,1:10:05.78,general text,,0,0,0,,destroying stones to save the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.86,1:10:09.08,general text,,0,0,0,,wanted to use it to save someone?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.16,1:10:11.24,general text,,0,0,0,,The letter reflects the madness and pain of a person,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.91,1:10:14.54,general text,,0,0,0,,ready to go against the laws of nature, just to save his beloved
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.37,1:10:20.38,general text,,0,0,0,,"Words of the Heart" is the confession of Master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.26,1:10:28.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t like it either
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.80,1:10:32.18,general text,,0,0,0,,So I will kill you painlessly
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.89,1:10:36.23,general text,,0,0,0,,This is not to show my death
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.52,1:10:39.56,general text,,0,0,0,,We are doing this to show how I will be resurrected
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.19,1:10:44.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Revive me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.65,1:10:47.24,general text,,0,0,0,,And don’t disappoint anyone
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.28,1:10:50.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Then let's not disappoint anyone
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.66,1:10:56.79,offscreen,,0,0,0,,A mother will kill her own daughter
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.94,1:11:54.11,memories,,0,0,0,,My beauty
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.61,1:11:57.40,memories,,0,0,0,,My Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.24,1:12:07.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.90,1:13:08.36,preview,,0,0,0,,Something went wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.44,1:13:09.94,preview,,0,0,0,,Something happened to the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.03,1:13:13.40,preview,,0,0,0,,When we approached the gate, a strong wind knocked us off our feet
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.49,1:13:15.20,preview,,0,0,0,,This definitely happened because of Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.07,1:13:17.70,preview,,0,0,0,,The children are there!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.78,1:13:18.83,preview,,0,0,0,,Young Ok!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.91,1:13:21.08,preview,,0,0,0,,My energy just came out through the sword
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.16,1:13:23.29,preview,,0,0,0,,I think the whole problem is the barrier
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.37,1:13:25.25,preview,,0,0,0,,Master Kahn has disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.42,1:13:30.09,preview,,0,0,0,,None of us can cast spells here. Why does he succeed?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.17,1:13:31.92,preview,,0,0,0,,We can't all die
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.01,1:13:34.01,preview,,0,0,0,,I will lure him and lock him in a secret room
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.09,1:13:35.68,preview,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook may die
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.22,1:13:39.36,preview,,0,0,0,,If the room is closed, he's probably already dead
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.07,1:13:42.69,preview,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, my student...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:57.18,nicks,,0,0,0,,
